ScamJacket Privacy Policy
Effective Date: June 2, 2026
1. Privacy Commitment ScamJacket is built on a "Privacy-First" architecture. All security scanning, app locking, and network filtering happen locally on your device. We do not use external servers to process your data, and we do not have a backend database where your information is stored.
2. Data Handled Locally (Does Not Leave Your Device)
•
App Lock Data: Your chosen PIN is stored as a salted hash on your device. We cannot recover this PIN if lost.
•
Usage Data: To provide app locking features, we monitor which application is currently in the foreground. This information is processed in real-time and is never logged or exported.
•
Security Alerts: Logs of suspicious activity (e.g., remote access tool detection) are stored locally for your review and can be cleared by you at any time.
•
Finance Protection List: The list of banking apps you choose to protect is stored only on your phone.
3. Use of Sensitive Permissions & APIs
•
Accessibility Service API: Used to detect app launches instantly and provide robust Uninstall Protection. It reads only the package names of apps being opened. It NEVER inspects screen content, reads your messages, captures keystrokes, or monitors private interactions.
•
VpnService: Used to create a local "sink" (dead-end) to block internet access for selected finance apps when a threat is detected. No traffic is ever routed to an external server, and no packet content is inspected.
•
Usage Access: Used as a fallback to detect foreground apps if the Accessibility Service is not enabled.
•
Phone State: Used to detect malicious call-forwarding codes (USSD codes) and carrier forwarding indicators to prevent call hijacking. We do not record calls or read call logs.
4. Data Sharing and Third Parties
•
No Third-Party SDKs: ScamJacket does not contain any third-party analytics (like Firebase or Mixpanel), crash reporting tools, or advertising SDKs.
•
No Data Selling: Since we do not collect your data on any server, we have no data to sell, share, or trade with third parties, advertisers, or government agencies.
5. Data Retention and Deletion All data is stored in the app's private storage. If you uninstall ScamJacket, all associated data, settings, and logs are permanently deleted by the Android system.
6. Changes to This Policy We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected by the "Effective Date" at the top of this policy and will be available within the app.
7. Contact If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, you can contact the developer through the contact information provided on the Google Play Store listing.
